.DS_Store

# Firebase project configuration. Held out of version control pending a
# decision from the product owner: it carries the project id, app id and the
# Android API key. None of those are secrets by Google's design (access is
# controlled by App Check and Firebase rules, and the key is restricted by
# package name), and Android projects normally do commit this file — but
# adding it later is one line, while removing it from history is not.
android/app/google-services.json
